<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: preferred -->
  <PreferredXenotype.label>preferido</PreferredXenotype.label>
  <!-- EN: Believers consider this xenotype to hold a higher moral or spiritual status than others. They will be happy if their colony has only preferred xenotypes. However, having any preferred xenotypes means that all other xenotypes are considered disliked and believers will be unhappy living alongside them. -->
  <PreferredXenotype.description>Os crentes consideram este xenotipo para manter um status moral ou espiritual mais elevado do que os outros. Eles serão felizes se sua colônia tem apenas xenotipos preferidos. No entanto, ter algum xenotipo preferido significa que todos os outros xenotipos são considerados desgostosos e os crentes serão infelizes vivendo ao lado deles.</PreferredXenotype.description>
  <!-- EN: Become a non-preferred xenotype -->
  <PreferredXenotype.comps.0.description>Torne-se um xenotipo não preferencial</PreferredXenotype.comps.0.description>
  <!-- EN: Preferred xenotype -->
  <PreferredXenotype.comps.1.thoughtStageDescriptions.0>Xenotipo preferido</PreferredXenotype.comps.1.thoughtStageDescriptions.0>
  <!-- EN: Disliked xenotype -->
  <PreferredXenotype.comps.1.thoughtStageDescriptions.1>Xenotipo não-gostado</PreferredXenotype.comps.1.thoughtStageDescriptions.1>
  <!-- EN: All preferred xenotypes -->
  <PreferredXenotype.comps.2.thoughtStageDescriptions.0>Todos os xenotipos preferidos</PreferredXenotype.comps.2.thoughtStageDescriptions.0>
  <!-- EN: Some disliked xenotypes -->
  <PreferredXenotype.comps.2.thoughtStageDescriptions.1>Alguns xenotipos desgostosos</PreferredXenotype.comps.2.thoughtStageDescriptions.1>
  <!-- EN: Many disliked xenotypes -->
  <PreferredXenotype.comps.2.thoughtStageDescriptions.2>Muitos xenotipos desgostosos</PreferredXenotype.comps.2.thoughtStageDescriptions.2>
  <!-- EN: Tons of disliked xenotypes -->
  <PreferredXenotype.comps.2.thoughtStageDescriptions.3>Toneladas de xenotipos desgostosos</PreferredXenotype.comps.2.thoughtStageDescriptions.3>
